dary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">11.02.4128<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 6, 2016<br/>Winter Update 2016</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Event</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170105135847&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Old_Rag_8b2393.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an old rag.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 3.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\">Green Piece of Cloth</a>. During the annual <a href=\"#/quest/tibia-anniversary\">Tibia Anniversary</a> event, Thirty of them need to be used on a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sewing%20Table\">Sewing Table</a> in order to trigger <i>party time</i> :\nduring which <a href=\"#/wiki/Pi%C3%B1ata%20Dragon\">Piñata Dragons</a> spawn around <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> and a world wide experience bonus of 15% lasting one hour is activated.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>During Tibia's 20th Anniversary starting January 5, 2017, They were dropped by <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclopes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolves</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Trolls</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Bear\">Bears</a>. Mistakenly, old rags started being dropped by these creatures again exactly one year later, on January 5, 2018. This was fixed on January 9 with Update 11.53.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"div-creature-list-generic creature-table\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclops</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Troll</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bear\">Bear</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Anniversary Unique Items</li><li>Clothing Accessories</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclops</a></li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\">Green Piece of Cloth</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pi%C3%B1ata%20Dragon\">Piñata Dragon</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/tibia-anniversary\">Tibia Anniversary</a></li><li>Tibia's 20th Anniversary</li><li>Tools (Objects)</li><li>Utilities</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["tibia-anniversary"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"tibia-anniversary","quest":"Tibia Anniversary","step":"0-0","n":1,"title":"Juntar Old Rags","kind":"needed","coords":[]},{"slug":"tibia-anniversary","quest":"Tibia Anniversary","step":"0-1","n":2,"title":"Usar os trapos na Sewing Table","kind":"needed","coords":[{"x":32300,"y":32261,"z":7,"label":"Sewing Table"}]}],"drops":[{"creature":"Cyclops","pct":0.171,"qty":"1","rarity":"raro","hp":"260","exp":"150","loc":"Plains of Havoc , Mount Sternum , Femor Hills , Cyclops Camp , Cyclopolis , Ancient Temple , Shadowthorn , Orc Fort , Mistrock , Foreigner Quarter , Outlaw Camp and in the Cyclops version of the Forsaken Mine .","places":[{"name":"Plains of Havoc","x":32735,"y":32297,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc"},{"name":"Mount Sternum","x":32494,"y":32072,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Mount%20Sternum"},{"name":"Femor Hills","x":32569,"y":31803,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Femor%20Hills"},{"name":"Cyclops Camp","x":32352,"y":32391,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Camp"},{"name":"Cyclopolis","x":33251,"y":31698,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Cyclopolis"},{"name":"Ancient Temple","x":32356,"y":32170,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Ancient%20Temple"},{"name":"Shadowthorn","x":33075,"y":32170,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Shadowthorn"},{"na